{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"644232","name":"فندق ماريانا","description":"يقع فندق Mariana في دبي، ويضم مطعماً وتراساً. يقع مكان الإقامة على بُعد 1. 7 كم من مركز توين تاورز للتسوق. تم تجهيز جميع الغرف بتكييف، وتضم بعض الغرف شرفة. يمكن الاستمتاع ببوفيه إفطار في مكان الإقامة. يمكن لموظفي مكتب الاستقبال الذي يعمل على مدار الساعة تقديم النصائح حول المنطقة. يقع مركز الغرير على بُعد 3. 3 كم من الفندق. ويقع أقرب مطار، وهو مطار دبي الدولي، على بُعد 8 كم من مكان الإقامة.","address":"Al Sabkha Street","city":"دبي","countryCode":"AE","postalCode":"83163","lat":25.2696839,"lng":55.3008593,"stars":1,"giataCode":"637169","phone":"+971042288320","email":"reservations@fourapplehotel.com","website":"http://www.marianahotel.ae/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_008.JPG","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_006.JPG","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_009.JPG","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_002.JPG","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_003.JPG","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_004.JPG","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_005.JPG","category":"exterior","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_a_007.JPG","category":"exterior","order":9},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/64/644232/644232a_hb_l_003.jpg","category":"lobby","ord